1. 200 (OK): The request was successful and the server returned the requested data.
2. 301 (Moved Permanently): The requested resource has been permanently moved to a new URL.
3. 404 (Not Found): The requested resource or webpage could not be found on the server.
4. 500 (Internal Server Error): The server encountered an unexpected error while processing the request.
5. 403 (Forbidden): Access is denied because the client does not have permission to view the resource.
